{"id":216,"date":"2026-02-16T00:28:15","date_gmt":"2026-02-16T06:28:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/127.0.0.1\/new-player-guide\/"},"modified":"2026-02-16T00:31:05","modified_gmt":"2026-02-16T06:31:05","slug":"new-player-guide","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.wolfguild.com\/new-player-guide\/","title":{"rendered":"New Player Guide"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>[et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#1f1f1f&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;80px||40px||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; max_width=&#8221;900px&#8221; module_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_font_size=&#8221;48px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h1>New Player Guide<\/h1>\n<p>Everything you need to know to get started in Kingdom of Drakkar.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section][et_pb_section fb_built=&#8221;1&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#1f1f1f&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;40px||40px||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_row _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; max_width=&#8221;900px&#8221; module_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>What is Kingdom of Drakkar?<\/h2>\n<p>Kingdom of Drakkar is a classic online multiplayer role-playing game (MMORPG) that has been running since the early days of online gaming. It features a persistent fantasy world with multiple realms to explore, monsters to fight, lairs to conquer, and a tight-knit community of players.<\/p>\n<p>Unlike modern MMOs, Drakkar has a retro aesthetic and focuses on group play, exploration, and character progression through a class and skill system. If you enjoy old-school RPGs where knowledge and teamwork matter more than flashy graphics, Drakkar is for you.<\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Getting Started<\/h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Visit <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kingdomofdrakkar.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">KingdomOfDrakkar.com<\/a> and download the game client<\/li>\n<li>Create an account and log in<\/li>\n<li>Create your first character: choose a race and class<\/li>\n<li>You will start in the town of Nork, the main hub for new players<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Your First 30 Minutes<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Talk to NPCs in Nork. They will give you quests and point you in the right direction<\/li>\n<li>Start fighting easy monsters near town to gain experience and learn the combat system<\/li>\n<li>Pick up loot and sell what you do not need at the shops<\/li>\n<li>Keep an eye on your health. Rest when you need to<\/li>\n<li>Do not be afraid to explore, but stay close to town until you get a feel for difficulty<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Common Mistakes to Avoid<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Going too deep too fast.<\/strong> The world gets dangerous quickly. Level up near town first<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ignoring other players.<\/strong> Drakkar is built around group play. Say hello, ask for tips, find a party<\/li>\n<li><strong>Hoarding low-level gear.<\/strong> Sell what you do not need. You will find better equipment as you progress<\/li>\n<li><strong>Skipping the wiki.<\/strong> The <a href=\"https:\/\/wiki.wolfguild.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">Wolf Guild Wiki<\/a> has answers to almost every question you will have<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Where to Ask Questions<\/h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/forum.wolfguild.com\/phpBB3\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">Wolf Guild Forums<\/a> are friendly and active. Post your questions and someone will answer<\/li>\n<li>In-game: just ask in chat. Drakkar players are helpful, especially to newcomers<\/li>\n<li>Browse the <a href=\"https:\/\/wiki.wolfguild.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #c39d63;\">Wiki<\/a> for guides on races, classes, quests, maps, and items<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][et_pb_text _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_2_font=&#8221;Playfair Display||||||||&#8221; header_2_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; header_2_font_size=&#8221;32px&#8221; text_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; text_text_color=&#8221;#c0c0c0&#8243; text_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; text_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;30px||||false|false&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2>Useful Links<\/h2>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][et_pb_row column_structure=&#8221;1_3,1_3,1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; max_width=&#8221;900px&#8221; module_alignment=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;1_3&#8243; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;][et_pb_blurb title=&#8221;Play Drakkar&#8221; url=&#8221;https:\/\/www.kingdomofdrakkar.com\/&#8221; url_new_window=&#8221;on&#8221; use_icon=&#8221;on&#8221; font_icon=&#8221;&#x4e;||divi||400&#8243; icon_color=&#8221;#c39d63&#8243; use_icon_font_size=&#8221;on&#8221; icon_font_size=&#8221;40px&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.27.2&#8243; header_font=&#8221;Montserrat|700|||||||&#8221; header_text_color=&#8221;#ffffff&#8221; body_font=&#8221;Montserrat||||||||&#8221; body_text_color=&#8221;#888888&#8243; body_font_size=&#8221;14px&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;center&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221;]